<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wicor upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wicor upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded WICOR Inc to near-, long-term buy from near-, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Wicor gained 5/8 to 34-1/2.</p>
